


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_0561210c:



    voice "2MI_0558"
    miyako "「嗯……唔……嘿」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_af66cd3a:


    "螃蟹终结者——圣夜子，正在名为挖蟹肉的战役里艰苦奋战着。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_f811b831:


    "虽说在料理前的加工时就已经将蟹壳剥掉了一部分，而且还准备了蟹勺，吃起来难度不算太大。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_7652304a:


    "不过这对圣夜子而言则是有生以来第一次的吃蟹挑战。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_692270be:



    voice "2HI_0722"
    hina "「圣夜子，在用蟹勺的时候把螃蟹立起来的话更容易挖出来的哦。要小心壳上的刺」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_384658b7:



    voice "2MI_0559"
    miyako "「好！啊，真的呢！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_a7f38d36:


    "圣夜子诚恳地听取了阳菜的建议。然后顺利地把蟹肉挖出来的她双眼闪着亮光。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_c6e3aa70:



    voice "2SA_0432"
    sachiko "「抱歉啊。事先剥掉壳再拿来做蟹柳锅会比较好吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_fa73e3d4:



    voice "2MI_0560"
    miyako "「不会，这才有意思！而且很好吃！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_434a1346:


    "圣夜子说着便把努力奋斗后的成果放入口中。然后朝下一只蟹脚动手。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_647ddcfd:



    voice "2SA_0433"
    sachiko "「这样吗，那就好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_13a595c8:


    "圣夜子全神贯注地掏着蟹肉的光景让人忍俊不禁。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_9b49a669:



    voice "2HI_0723"
    hina "「圣夜子真的是无论做什么都好认真好拼命呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_6a2c75aa:



    voice "2SA_0434"
    sachiko "「对呀。那孩子可乖了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_0850f840:



    voice "2HI_0724"
    hina "「相比之下——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_0f411b5f:


    "阳菜喟然叹息着并将视线转向另一边。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_5d8332f2:



    voice "2FU_0566"
    fumi "「我帮你把蟹肉给取好了喔」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_d42d7c88:



    voice "2RI_0737"
    rin "「哇～吃着真方便」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_83b305ef:



    voice "2FU_0567"
    fumi "「接着想吃什么呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_eac674dd:



    voice "2RI_0738"
    rin "「我还要吃螃蟹～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_190b2b5a:



    voice "2FU_0568"
    fumi "「喂喂，不吃蔬菜可不行哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_0e860974:



    voice "2RI_0739"
    rin "「等这次吃完螃蟹我就吃蔬菜～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_7e0e40c9:



    voice "2FU_0569"
    fumi "「真的吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_a1be1c79:



    voice "2RI_0740"
    rin "「真的喔～♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_ec68cd8b:



    voice "2FU_0570"
    fumi "「真拿你没办法呀」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_dcbfdb4f:


    "说着，文又从锅里夹出一只螃蟹然后面带微笑地鼓捣起蟹肉来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_162d9798:



    voice "2HI_0725"
    hina "「这怎么回事啊！？喂！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_910ca78e:



    voice "2SA_0435"
    sachiko "「你跟我说这个有什么用啊～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_f73b156b:



    voice "2RI_0741"
    rin "「文，我的眼镜起雾了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_ad45a081:



    voice "2FU_0571"
    fumi "「真的诶。蒸汽都蒙上去了呢。你等一下，我马上帮你擦干净」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_84fd24b3:



    voice "2RI_0742"
    rin "「我看不见了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_d9833355:



    voice "2HI_0726"
    hina "「这宿舍是幼儿园吗！？浅生是伦的妈妈么！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_6abb4d36:



    voice "2SA_0436"
    sachiko "「别～问～我～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_7d9a1620:


    "祥子被阳菜猛烈地晃着肩膀而发出了带颤音的说话声。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_2218008f:


    "确实在吃火锅的过程中，伦大半的时间都是在使劲地撒娇，而文则是宠溺地照料着她。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_35bb9b41:


    "文当然是负责从锅里夹菜的那个，同时还得清理掉落在桌上的东西。而且——"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_0083ae02:



    voice "2RI_0743"
    rin "「烫」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_e78eccbd:



    voice "2FU_0572"
    fumi "「啊，很烫吗？我帮你把菜吹凉一点吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_2d675744:


    "文从伦的手里接过碗碟并准备将剥好的蟹肉吹凉。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_45b1e3a5:



    voice "2HI_0727"
    hina "「……热腾腾的关东煮……热腾腾的关东煮」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_44f55c49:



    voice "2SA_0437"
    sachiko "「嘛嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_1d2574fb:



    voice "2FU_0573"
    fumi "「呼……呼……这样差不多可以了吧？来，张嘴啊～嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_9be4b409:



    voice "2RI_0744"
    rin "「啊～嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_f8fb4b76:



    voice "2HI_0728"
    hina "「………………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_093c846d:



    voice "2SA_0438"
    sachiko "「啊，不出声了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_d42f1b75:



    voice "2HI_0729"
    hina "「我说这个，好像不是伦自个儿在耍任性，而是连浅生都乐在其中地宠伦了啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_d1a475c3:



    voice "2SA_0439"
    sachiko "「这是叫共生依存性来着？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_a3480455:



    voice "2HI_0730"
    hina "「这样下去真的没事吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_6a2b2b2b:



    voice "2SA_0440"
    sachiko "「阳菜，要不要我也来呼呼吹然后喂你吃呢？来，啊～嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_eaff0b05:


    "祥子用筷子夹着菜送到阳菜的嘴边。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_6e153ecd:



    voice "2HI_0731"
    hina "「谁想非礼你啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_81106817:



    voice "2SA_0441"
    sachiko "「切，真没劲。圣夜夜呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_f87d5c98:



    voice "2MI_0561"
    miyako "「嗯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_2f785fc4:



    voice "2SA_0442"
    sachiko "「啊～嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_4c1bbac5:



    voice "2MI_0562"
    miyako "「啊——嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_03_fdb087b2:


    "真乖。"
